{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Welcome to Grandmother\u2019s Village</strong> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3873330/extras/e74ca627add1f2507a9d4df69b7132eb.poster.avif?t=1774254917\" width=1170 height=410 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3873330/extras/e74ca627add1f2507a9d4df69b7132eb.webm?t=1774254917\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3873330/extras/e74ca627add1f2507a9d4df69b7132eb.mp4?t=1774254917\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Redhowl is a social deduction game with proximity voice chat for 4 to 15 players, inspired by Little Red Riding Hood, blending real-time action with structured debate phases. Complete quests, use unique powers, and unmask the Wolves hidden within the village. Between day, night, and council phases, sabotage, investigate, and survive. Every match is unpredictable: will you save the village, or be devoured?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>3 FACTIONS, 13 UNIQUE ROLES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>THE CHAPERONS: INVESTIGATE AND SURVIVE</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3873330/extras/c056bae836515efffaa2d43e19f7385b.poster.avif?t=1774254917\" width=1170 height=410 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3873330/extras/c056bae836515efffaa2d43e19f7385b.webm?t=1774254917\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3873330/extras/c056bae836515efffaa2d43e19f7385b.mp4?t=1774254917\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Chaperons work to ensure the village\u2019s prosperity under Grandmother\u2019s guidance. They must cooperate, investigate, and uncover traitors using their unique abilities, each capable of influencing the course of the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>THE WOLVES: DEVOUR THE VILLAGE</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3873330/extras/73e23df6d04370deb3fc11d26df42eac.poster.avif?t=1774254917\" width=1170 height=410 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3873330/extras/73e23df6d04370deb3fc11d26df42eac.webm?t=1774254917\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3873330/extras/73e23df6d04370deb3fc11d26df42eac.mp4?t=1774254917\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Reveal your true nature, beneath every hood may lurk a hungry Wolf. Take advantage of the night and powerful sabotage abilities to sow doubt among the Chaperons. Invoke the Blood Moon, a chaotic night that may turn everything upside down\u2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>THE ASSASSIN: THE LONE PREDATOR</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3873330/extras/ae59c9dfc8db362c74be0b1e4bde2b31.poster.avif?t=1774254917\" width=1170 height=410 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3873330/extras/ae59c9dfc8db362c74be0b1e4bde2b31.webm?t=1774254917\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3873330/extras/ae59c9dfc8db362c74be0b1e4bde2b31.mp4?t=1774254917\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Pursue your own objectives and play the troublemaker. Hunt down and eliminate designated players, regardless of their faction.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>THE CHAOS OF THE BLOOD MOON</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3873330/extras/268bc24302da55e2185c0d22eb899ba5.poster.avif?t=1774254917\" width=1170 height=410 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3873330/extras/268bc24302da55e2185c0d22eb899ba5.webm?t=1774254917\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3873330/extras/268bc24302da55e2185c0d22eb899ba5.mp4?t=1774254917\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>The Blood Moon is a one-time-per-match event featuring four random variants capable of radically altering the rules of the game. One of them, extremely rare and devastating, combines all three variants at once.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>AN IMMERSION AT THE HEART OF THE GAME</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3873330/extras/b0ff2aedbbf0a4a13a18b32f2c863120.poster.avif?t=1774254917\" width=1170 height=410 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3873330/extras/b0ff2aedbbf0a4a13a18b32f2c863120.webm?t=1774254917\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3873330/extras/b0ff2aedbbf0a4a13a18b32f2c863120.mp4?t=1774254917\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Enter a world where gameplay and atmosphere coexist. Alternate between peaceful days, oppressive nights, and the Blood Moon, a night steeped in a nightmarish atmosphere. Discover the spectral realm as well, where fallen players return as ghosts, still able to haunt the village and interact with the world of the living.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Support Redhowl</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you like what you see, add Redhowl to your wishlist and join our Discord playtests to experience the village firsthand.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3873330/extras/7ea5299ebd41a7a190a93651eacb1603.poster.avif?t=1774254917\" width=1170 height=176 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3873330/extras/7ea5299ebd41a7a190a93651eacb1603.webm?t=1774254917\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3873330/extras/7ea5299ebd41a7a190a93651eacb1603.mp4?t=1774254917\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3873330?t=1774254917","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3873330/e0b4c9df62e7afb1025e8abde5356700661aa25e/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1774254917","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3873330/21691e348b400215a0b3bd74b974103a5f150b3b/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1774254917","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3873330/21691e348b400215a0b3bd74b974103a5f150b3b/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1774254917","categories":[{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficu