ps/3873330/extras/ae59c9dfc8db362c74be0b1e4bde2b31.webm?t=1774254917\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3873330/extras/ae59c9dfc8db362c74be0b1e4bde2b31.mp4?t=1774254917\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Pursue your own objectives and play the troublemaker. Hunt down and eliminate designated players, regardless of their faction.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>THE CHAOS OF THE BLOOD MOON</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3873330/extras/268bc24302da55e2185c0d22eb899ba5.poster.avif?t=1774254917\" width=1170 height=410 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3873330/extras/268bc24302da55e2185c0d22eb899ba5.webm?t=1774254917\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3873330/extras/268bc24302da55e2185c0d22eb899ba5.mp4?t=1774254917\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>The Blood Moon is a one-time-per-match event featuring four random variants capable of radically altering the rules of the game. One of them, extremely rare and devastating, combines all three variants at once.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>AN IMMERSION AT THE HEART OF THE GAME</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3873330/extras/b0ff2aedbbf0a4a13a18b32f2c863120.poster.avif?t=1774254917\" width=1170 height=410 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3873330/extras/b0ff2aedbbf0a4a13a18b32f2c863120.webm?t=1774254917\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3873330/extras/b0ff2aedbbf0a4a13a18b32f2c863120.mp4?t=1774254917\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Enter a world where gameplay and atmosphere coexist. Alternate between peaceful days, oppressive nights, and the Blood Moon, a night steeped in a nightmarish atmosphere. Discover the spectral realm as well, where fallen players return as ghosts, still able to haunt the village and interact with the world of the living.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Support Redhowl</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you like what you see, add Redhowl to your wishlist and join our Discord playtests to experience the village firsthand.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3873330/extras/7ea5299ebd41a7a190a93651eacb1603.poster.avif?t=1774254917\" width=1170 height=176 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3873330/extras/7ea5299ebd41a7a190a93651eacb1603.webm?t=1774254917\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3873330/extras/7ea5299ebd41a7a190a93651eacb1603.mp4?t=1774254917\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","developers":["BENOM STUDIO"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3873330/6268cf02760da1b62abf5677f8b0db12b0e8c0bf/header.jpg?t=1774254917","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3873330/813171042/33bb0012d961722c6d97381f52097852d1569ef9/1770133185/dash_av1.mpd?t=1770134206","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3873330/813171042/33bb0012d961